# Windows scripts must never be checked out with LF line ends: cmd.exe mis-parses labels and
# multi line blocks in LF batch files. The installer scripts carry a UTF-8 BOM, which git keeps as
# content (scripts/build_release.py writes CRLF and the BOM again when it packs them).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
installer/*.txt text eol=crlf
